  "source_caption": "The “you shall be king” prophecy is one of the most powerful moments of Episode 3, “The Squire.”\n\nWhen the fortune teller tells young Egg that he will be king and die in a hot fire, it completely shifts how you see his journey. Now that all episodes of A Knight of the Seven Kingdoms are out, that scene feels even heavier knowing where his story leads.\n\nPeter Claffey as Dunk and Dexter Sol Ansell as Egg really brought heart to the series, and moments like this are what made the show stand out.\n\nNow that the full season is out, what did you think of it?",
